}
```

What does this program print?

```java
void main() {
    char c = 'a';
    c += 2;
    IO.println(c);
}
```

This uses the old colon form of `switch`. What does it print?

```java
void main() {
    int count = 0;
    int day = 2;
    switch (day) {
        case 1: count += 1;
        case 2: count += 10;
        case 3: count += 100;
            break;
        default: count += 1000;
    }
    IO.println(count);
}
```

